WEBVTT

01:33.459 --> 01:35.429
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.500 --> 01:37.929
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.000 --> 01:40.870
(Episode 36)

01:49.879 --> 01:50.709
Here.

01:51.280 --> 01:51.950
Have some water.

01:54.650 --> 01:55.819
You suddenly called...

01:55.879 --> 01:56.920
and said you wanted to stay at my place.

01:56.980 --> 01:58.189
I was quite surprised.

01:58.450 --> 01:59.189
After all,

01:59.250 --> 02:00.689
we're not that close.

02:01.120 --> 02:02.289
And from what I know about you,

02:02.360 --> 02:04.289
you're not someone who doesn't care about social distancing.

02:05.959 --> 02:06.829
Sorry to bother you.

02:07.189 --> 02:08.799
Sorry and thank you.

02:10.459 --> 02:11.870
You win.

02:12.230 --> 02:13.599
You get to say everything.

02:19.009 --> 02:19.810
You're a doctor.

02:19.870 --> 02:21.310
Why is the house so messy?

02:22.080 --> 02:24.280
You're complaining when you're staying here?

02:24.639 --> 02:26.280
This is what you call lived-in.

02:27.050 --> 02:27.879
If you ask me,

02:27.949 --> 02:29.550
I think you have mysophobia.

02:30.050 --> 02:31.419
They say people have mysophobia...

02:31.490 --> 02:32.590
because their heart is in turmoil.

02:32.650 --> 02:34.620
That's why they can't tolerate the mess around them.

02:35.020 --> 02:36.289
You're sick. You need to be cured.

02:39.990 --> 02:41.599
(Song Yan)

02:59.080 --> 03:00.150
Runaway princess.

03:00.909 --> 03:02.720
Are you hungry? Do you want to eat something?

03:04.280 --> 03:04.990
Yes.

03:05.849 --> 03:06.620
Wait here.

03:13.490 --> 03:14.590
Let's have dumplings.

03:15.560 --> 03:16.930
I'll cook for you. Wait for me.

03:17.000 --> 03:17.659
Okay.

03:32.849 --> 03:33.680
Where did you go?

03:34.250 --> 03:35.080
To a colleague's house.

03:35.349 --> 03:36.150
What is it?

03:37.949 --> 03:38.689
Which colleague?

03:39.419 --> 03:40.349
What do you want?

03:41.419 --> 03:42.289
I want to pick you up.

03:45.930 --> 03:46.859
Why?

03:46.930 --> 03:48.229
Have you decided what to tell me?

04:57.960 --> 04:59.130
I haven't seen Qin Er for a long time.

04:59.200 --> 05:00.099
What has she been up to?

05:04.099 --> 05:05.010
You're her brother.

05:05.510 --> 05:06.640
Don't you know anything?

05:07.770 --> 05:08.979
As for your sister,

05:09.280 --> 05:11.010
it wasn't easy for her to persevere until now...

05:11.210 --> 05:12.849
under the huge pressure from your mom.

05:16.520 --> 05:17.619
Do you think...

05:18.820 --> 05:20.349
she'll keep persevering?

05:22.460 --> 05:23.260
I suppose so.

05:24.020 --> 05:24.720
What else?

05:26.729 --> 05:27.789
What about you?

05:29.059 --> 05:29.760
How have you been lately?

05:32.599 --> 05:33.700
I know everything.

05:34.970 --> 05:36.970
A few days ago, you went out for a meal with a girl.

05:37.539 --> 05:38.710
Look, I'll be serious.

05:39.809 --> 05:41.369
I'm all for you dating...

05:41.440 --> 05:42.640
and starting a new life.

05:42.979 --> 05:44.440
But with that girl from my bar?

05:44.880 --> 05:46.049
Absolutely not.

05:47.809 --> 05:48.650
You're overthinking it.

05:49.320 --> 05:50.979
I just don't want to see her go astray.

05:51.989 --> 05:52.789
In short,

05:54.020 --> 05:55.659
we have nothing to do with each other.

06:12.440 --> 06:14.609
Last month's money is...

06:14.869 --> 06:16.080
After taxes,

06:16.140 --> 06:18.609
it's 19,046.40 yuan.

06:18.679 --> 06:19.809
I'll transfer half of it to you.

06:24.249 --> 06:26.020
Okay, it's transferred. Check it.

06:29.890 --> 06:31.559
Say something.

06:31.859 --> 06:34.090
I've always been the only one worried about this.

06:34.159 --> 06:35.530
Even when you're getting the money,

06:35.599 --> 06:36.960
you're dawdling.

06:37.460 --> 06:38.299
I got it.

06:40.830 --> 06:42.169
Isn't it...

06:42.239 --> 06:44.140
about 1,000 yuan less than last month?

06:45.039 --> 06:46.270
If the sales don't go up,

06:46.340 --> 06:47.570
there's nothing I can do.

06:47.640 --> 06:49.239
I've been racking my brain.

06:49.780 --> 06:50.940
But I can't come up...

06:51.010 --> 06:53.210
with a bestseller plan by myself all day.

07:00.849 --> 07:02.119
Are you not feeling well?

07:03.159 --> 07:04.260
What's wrong with your back?

07:04.760 --> 07:05.890
I exercised too much...

07:05.960 --> 07:07.289
during the last PE class.

07:08.530 --> 07:09.859
Lie down then.

07:16.840 --> 07:17.640
Do you think...

07:17.700 --> 07:19.440
I hurt my spine?

07:21.309 --> 07:22.780
Will I become disabled?

07:24.210 --> 07:25.010
No.

07:25.179 --> 07:26.780
I need to go to the hospital for a checkup.

07:27.849 --> 07:28.820
I'll go with you.

07:30.549 --> 07:32.020
- Come down slowly. - Okay.

07:42.030 --> 07:42.799
Get up.

07:45.229 --> 07:46.070
You're fine.

07:46.130 --> 07:47.669
You just pulled a muscle.

07:47.900 --> 07:49.270
I'll prescribe you an all-purpose medicine.

07:49.340 --> 07:50.400
Apply it three times a day.

07:50.470 --> 07:51.700
Stop when the pain subsides.

07:52.739 --> 07:53.770
It's that simple?

07:53.970 --> 07:55.539
Don't I need an X-ray or something?

07:55.809 --> 07:56.840
Is my back...

07:56.909 --> 07:58.309
broken?

07:59.380 --> 08:00.679
You're so energetic.

08:00.749 --> 08:02.749
If it's really broken, it'll be a medical miracle.

08:07.190 --> 08:08.320
It's almost lunchtime.

08:08.390 --> 08:09.559
Do you want to eat with me?

08:10.159 --> 08:10.890
No.

08:10.960 --> 08:12.090
I'm really not feeling well.

08:12.159 --> 08:13.359
I'd better go back and lie down.

08:14.890 --> 08:16.900
Take this and get the medicine from the pharmacy.

08:17.559 --> 08:18.229
Okay.

08:18.299 --> 08:19.630
Thank you, Xu Qin. I'll get going.

08:19.700 --> 08:20.429
Okay, go ahead.

08:30.940 --> 08:32.249
Give me the prescription. I'll get the medicine for you.

08:32.309 --> 08:33.080
Okay.

08:52.599 --> 08:53.399
Yan Chen.

08:55.099 --> 08:56.470
I told you it was fine.

08:56.940 --> 08:58.099
I was in the area...

08:58.269 --> 08:59.570
and had a meal with a partner.

08:59.869 --> 09:00.910
So I brought some food for you.

09:02.580 --> 09:03.410
So...

09:04.080 --> 09:05.410
did Mom say anything to you?

09:06.509 --> 09:07.310
No.

09:09.220 --> 09:10.019
Does this matter...

09:11.420 --> 09:12.790
really not affect you and him?

09:13.519 --> 09:14.790
Do you want it to affect us...

09:14.889 --> 09:15.989
or not?

09:17.190 --> 09:18.190
I just hope...

09:19.259 --> 09:20.629
that you won't accommodate him too much...

09:21.389 --> 09:22.399
and make yourself suffer.

09:27.029 --> 09:27.930
I'm not.

09:29.170 --> 09:30.269
All right, Yan Chen. Don't worry.

09:30.340 --> 09:31.739
Go. I'll get back to work.

09:47.249 --> 09:48.090
Mr. Meng.

09:50.820 --> 09:51.590
It's really you.

09:51.660 --> 09:52.859
I thought I was mistaken.

09:55.700 --> 09:56.800
You don't look good.

09:56.859 --> 09:58.430
Are you not feeling well?

09:59.229 --> 10:00.029
No.

10:02.499 --> 10:04.369
Then have you been busy lately?

10:05.670 --> 10:06.670
What's the matter?

10:08.540 --> 10:10.440
It's nothing. Don't get me wrong.

10:10.509 --> 10:11.879
I don't like owing people.

10:12.009 --> 10:13.109
You treated me to a meal last time.

10:13.180 --> 10:14.509
I've been wanting to treat you back.

10:15.979 --> 10:17.080
I've been doing well on my livestream lately...

10:17.149 --> 10:18.119
and just got paid.

10:18.180 --> 10:19.450
- Why don't we... - It's okay.

10:23.160 --> 10:23.920
I'll get going.

10:30.859 --> 10:31.759
Hello?

10:32.899 --> 10:34.170
All right, wait for me. I'll be right there.

10:58.859 --> 10:59.660
Xiao Ge.

11:01.229 --> 11:01.960
Chief.

11:02.060 --> 11:03.060
- Hello, Chief. - Come down.

11:04.499 --> 11:05.330
Yes.

11:14.570 --> 11:15.379
Chief.

11:17.139 --> 11:17.879
Have you been...

11:18.540 --> 11:19.349
doing well lately?

11:22.580 --> 11:23.349
I...

11:23.649 --> 11:26.389
Did I make any mistakes, Chief?

11:28.290 --> 11:29.619
How are things with your girlfriend?

11:30.590 --> 11:31.389
It's fine.

11:32.290 --> 11:33.060
Really?

11:34.529 --> 11:35.830
She didn't tell on me, did she?

11:36.200 --> 11:37.999
We only had a fight last week.

11:38.399 --> 11:40.670
But I've definitely cajoled her.

11:41.470 --> 11:42.470
How?

11:45.040 --> 11:46.639
I just apologized,

11:47.340 --> 11:48.269
called her,

11:48.739 --> 11:49.540
bought a gift,

11:49.879 --> 11:51.479
kissed her, hugged her, and held her high.

11:57.749 --> 11:59.050
When girls get angry,

11:59.420 --> 12:01.389
what's the usual cause?

12:02.460 --> 12:04.420
Chief, speaking about this,

12:04.489 --> 12:06.759
girls change faster than flipping a page.

12:06.960 --> 12:07.790
Especially...

12:12.529 --> 12:13.430
Chief.

12:14.399 --> 12:15.940
You made Dr. Xu angry?

12:19.710 --> 12:20.670
Just answer me.

12:23.609 --> 12:24.910
What did you do...

12:24.979 --> 12:25.950
to make her angry?

12:26.910 --> 12:27.979
What could I have done?

12:28.050 --> 12:29.119
I didn't do anything.

12:29.720 --> 12:31.920
Chief, that's not the right attitude.

12:32.420 --> 12:34.519
How can you say you didn't do anything?

12:34.619 --> 12:36.560
When a girl is angry,

12:36.619 --> 12:38.060
you can't say you didn't do anything.

12:44.129 --> 12:45.259
Does Dr. Xu...

12:45.330 --> 12:46.599
always get angry at you?

12:47.300 --> 12:48.629
Nonsense. She's nice.

12:49.470 --> 12:50.639
Exactly.

12:50.739 --> 12:52.040
Then it's your fault.

12:52.109 --> 12:53.269
Just apologize.

12:53.340 --> 12:55.710
- That's right. Apologize. - That's right. Apologize.

12:55.779 --> 12:57.680
Just apologize. It's not a big deal.

13:01.580 --> 13:02.550
I'm talking about Xiao Ge.

13:02.619 --> 13:03.950
Why are you making a fuss?

13:04.550 --> 13:05.379
Get back to training.

13:05.920 --> 13:06.749
So stubborn.

13:07.519 --> 13:08.420
Just be stubborn.

13:08.489 --> 13:09.619
As a firefighter,

13:09.820 --> 13:10.989
you can't even put out your own fire.

13:13.460 --> 13:14.290
He ran away.

13:14.889 --> 13:16.129
What are you waiting for? Come up and tell us.

13:16.200 --> 13:17.229
- Hurry up. - Hurry.

13:25.269 --> 13:28.070
(Have you eaten lunch?)

13:39.590 --> 13:43.090
(I'm eating now.)

13:58.200 --> 14:00.040
(Eat more.)

14:05.340 --> 14:07.580
Don't you have anything else to say?

14:37.479 --> 14:39.580
Social assistance.

14:40.180 --> 14:41.249
You guys, come with me.

14:41.310 --> 14:42.720
- Yes. - Yes.

14:43.950 --> 14:44.720
What's wrong?

14:45.019 --> 14:45.749
Doctor.

14:46.249 --> 14:47.320
I have a headache.

14:47.849 --> 14:49.359
Give me a prescription for pethidine.

14:51.290 --> 14:53.690
This medicine can't be prescribed just like that.

14:53.989 --> 14:55.330
How about this? I'll start you off with a lab order.

14:55.389 --> 14:56.359
- Go for a test. - There's no need.

14:56.430 --> 14:58.460
I know it's just a headache.

14:58.700 --> 15:00.330
Hurry up and prescribe it.

15:00.430 --> 15:01.499
The hospital has its rules.

15:01.570 --> 15:02.840
We're taking responsibility for you.

15:02.899 --> 15:04.239
Go for a test first, okay?

15:04.470 --> 15:06.310
Others can prescribe it, but you can't?

15:06.570 --> 15:07.639
I want pethidine.

15:07.769 --> 15:09.279
Pethidine!

15:09.340 --> 15:10.479
Calm down.

15:10.540 --> 15:11.840
It's not that I won't give it to you.

15:11.910 --> 15:12.580
But I have...

15:12.649 --> 15:13.950
- to follow the hospital's rules. - Prescribe it!

15:14.379 --> 15:15.249
It's not that I won't give it to you.

15:15.349 --> 15:16.349
Will you give it to me?

15:16.550 --> 15:17.680
- I can't. - Someone is causing trouble.

15:17.749 --> 15:18.720
- I can't! - Call security. Hurry.

15:19.119 --> 15:20.619
Will you give it to me?

15:21.050 --> 15:22.889
Calm down. Put down the knife.

15:22.960 --> 15:23.960
I...

15:24.320 --> 15:25.090
I'll look for it myself.

15:25.259 --> 15:25.960
I'm sure you have it.

15:26.229 --> 15:27.190
It must be here.

15:27.359 --> 15:28.590
Call security.

15:29.430 --> 15:31.430
Stop rummaging. I don't have pethidine!

15:32.300 --> 15:33.670
Give me pethidine!

15:36.739 --> 15:37.540
Don't move.

15:38.940 --> 15:40.269
Where is it? Where is the pethidine?

15:40.340 --> 15:41.410
- Put down the knife. - Here!

15:42.710 --> 15:43.810
- Give it to me! - I know where the pethidine is.

15:46.910 --> 15:50.050
- Don't move! - Don't move!

15:50.119 --> 15:53.019
- Don't move! - Get down!

15:53.220 --> 15:55.349
- Get down! - Get down!

15:56.790 --> 15:57.859
Hang in there.

16:01.290 --> 16:02.060
This way.

16:06.599 --> 16:07.430
Dr. Guo is here.

16:08.700 --> 16:09.570
Dr. Guo.

16:09.940 --> 16:11.399
I said I'm fine.

16:11.470 --> 16:12.369
You don't have to bother yourself.

16:12.440 --> 16:13.109
Even if you're a doctor yourself,

16:13.170 --> 16:14.509
you should listen to your colleagues.

16:14.769 --> 16:16.210
Dr. Guo, please take a look at her.

16:16.279 --> 16:17.080
Okay.

16:19.080 --> 16:19.979
Clench.

16:21.180 --> 16:21.979
Open.

16:23.379 --> 16:24.779
See? I'm really fine.

16:25.580 --> 16:26.450
Luckily, it's not serious.

16:26.519 --> 16:27.820
Her nerves aren't injured.

16:28.119 --> 16:29.460
I'll give you an anesthetic to stitch you up.

16:29.790 --> 16:31.090
- Get the anesthetic. - Okay.

16:32.090 --> 16:33.430
Thank you, Dr. Guo.

16:36.729 --> 16:38.800
The weather is cold and dry lately.

16:38.859 --> 16:40.029
The wound is less likely to get infected.

16:40.499 --> 16:41.670
But just to be safe,

16:42.129 --> 16:43.499
you have to take anti-inflammatory medicine on time.

16:43.970 --> 16:44.800
Don't get it wet.

16:44.869 --> 16:46.210
Don't bend your wrist.

16:46.269 --> 16:47.310
You don't want it to get infected.

16:48.109 --> 16:49.509
Thank you. I'll be careful.

16:50.710 --> 16:51.779
You have to listen to her.

16:51.979 --> 16:52.749
Don't get your wound wet.

16:53.580 --> 16:54.550
Okay.

16:55.609 --> 16:57.050
Do you still have anti-inflammatory medicine?

16:57.119 --> 16:58.050
Should I prescribe some for you?

16:58.349 --> 16:59.190
I do.

16:59.349 --> 17:00.320
Don't worry.

17:08.359 --> 17:09.229
Dr. Xu.

17:31.620 --> 17:33.650
Do you know how important...

17:33.720 --> 17:34.690
a surgeon's hands are?

17:36.259 --> 17:37.989
You're completely irresponsible to yourself.

17:39.089 --> 17:40.860
I've always been careful.

17:40.989 --> 17:42.190
It was just an accident.

17:42.430 --> 17:43.299
What did Dr. Guo say?

17:43.930 --> 17:46.100
She said the wound is superficial. I'm fine.

17:47.900 --> 17:49.269
I just need to make sure it doesn't get infected.

17:51.670 --> 17:53.039
Take a few days off.

17:53.640 --> 17:54.769
Come back when your hand is better.

17:59.479 --> 18:00.549
When you fill out the form...

18:00.610 --> 18:02.009
for the research group selection,

18:02.920 --> 18:03.779
you can come back.

18:05.549 --> 18:06.249
I...

18:06.350 --> 18:07.519
I can participate?

18:08.650 --> 18:09.789
You deserve it.

18:10.190 --> 18:11.160
Don't be surprised.

18:13.789 --> 18:14.630
Dr. Xu.

18:15.160 --> 18:17.299
I know you must have helped me.

18:17.799 --> 18:18.600
Thank you.

18:20.130 --> 18:21.100
Don't thank me.

18:21.729 --> 18:22.799
You're a rare talent.

18:22.870 --> 18:23.700
The hospital also wants...

18:23.870 --> 18:25.140
to focus on training you.

18:26.039 --> 18:27.170
But you have to remember.

18:27.370 --> 18:28.569
No matter what you do,

18:28.739 --> 18:30.110
what will help you in the end...

18:30.779 --> 18:32.079
is your ability.

18:35.110 --> 18:35.950
I'll remember that.

18:51.499 --> 18:52.400
That was fast.

18:52.930 --> 18:54.470
I had to be quick to pick you up.

18:55.029 --> 18:55.870
Come on, get in.

19:08.309 --> 19:09.420
What happened to your hand?

19:09.920 --> 19:11.319
I got scratched by a piece of glass.

19:11.380 --> 19:12.519
No big deal.

19:12.850 --> 19:13.650
You're fine?

19:14.120 --> 19:14.989
Are you sure?

19:15.190 --> 19:16.289
I'm fine.

19:16.420 --> 19:17.690
I even took days off.

19:18.160 --> 19:20.390
If it was really bad, I wouldn't be in this state.

19:21.229 --> 19:22.860
But I don't think you're in a good state.

19:23.529 --> 19:24.329
What's wrong?

19:26.630 --> 19:28.100
I have nowhere to go.

19:29.569 --> 19:30.900
Did you have a fight with your boyfriend?

19:31.700 --> 19:32.470
Come on.

19:32.940 --> 19:33.870
Tell me about it.

19:35.069 --> 19:36.779
Can you drive first?

19:52.759 --> 19:53.559
Stop walking.

19:53.860 --> 19:55.690
What happened? Tell me.

19:58.630 --> 19:59.569
Let me ask you.

20:01.430 --> 20:03.640
If someone you want to spend the rest of your life with...

20:03.739 --> 20:05.170
is hiding something from you,

20:05.239 --> 20:06.170
can you accept it?

20:06.640 --> 20:07.610
Well, you have to ask...

20:07.670 --> 20:09.069
the person I'm going to marry.

20:09.140 --> 20:10.410
If I get married,

20:10.479 --> 20:12.549
I'll have a lot of things to hide from her.

20:12.610 --> 20:13.710
She can't know.

20:13.950 --> 20:14.910
If she finds out,

20:14.979 --> 20:15.920
the wedding will be called off.

20:15.979 --> 20:17.150
It will be a mess.

20:18.579 --> 20:19.789
I knew it.

20:19.850 --> 20:21.049
You never say anything serious.

20:21.190 --> 20:23.160
I'm telling you the truth.

20:23.360 --> 20:24.589
It's from the bottom of my heart.

20:25.620 --> 20:26.489
You just said...

20:27.190 --> 20:28.259
he's hiding something from you.

20:28.890 --> 20:30.329
What's wrong? Is he cheating on you?

20:30.860 --> 20:31.860
No.

20:32.029 --> 20:33.370
What are you talking about?

20:34.069 --> 20:34.900
That's right.

20:35.100 --> 20:36.370
He's not that kind of person.

20:36.940 --> 20:38.039
Then what is it?

20:38.700 --> 20:40.110
He doesn't say a word...

20:40.170 --> 20:41.170
about his past experiences.

20:41.470 --> 20:42.239
No matter what I ask him,

20:42.309 --> 20:43.880
he never gives me a clear answer.

20:46.579 --> 20:47.710
In this kind of situation,

20:49.720 --> 20:50.720
it's either...

20:51.319 --> 20:53.450
he has something he's not proud of,

20:53.850 --> 20:56.289
or just mentioning it will make him suffer.

20:57.420 --> 21:00.029
Who doesn't have their own little secrets?

21:00.289 --> 21:02.059
Why do you have to know?

21:02.660 --> 21:04.559
I don't have to know.

21:04.630 --> 21:06.799
I just think his attitude toward it isn't right.

21:07.470 --> 21:09.170
What is it that he must hide it from me?

21:10.140 --> 21:11.069
With our relationship,

21:11.140 --> 21:12.769
doesn't he deserve to be honest with me?

21:13.239 --> 21:14.170
If he's already like this now,

21:14.239 --> 21:15.470
what about in the future?

21:16.539 --> 21:18.410
You're actually feeling unease, aren't you?

21:24.819 --> 21:26.049
Why would I be?

21:35.589 --> 21:36.999
Because from your perspective,

21:37.499 --> 21:38.729
you disregarded your parents'...

21:38.799 --> 21:40.229
objections and obstacles.

21:40.829 --> 21:42.200
You gave up a lot of things...

21:42.269 --> 21:43.769
and chose to be with him.

21:45.640 --> 21:47.140
But the way he treats you now...

21:48.110 --> 21:49.009
makes you scared.

21:59.549 --> 22:00.450
Coming.

22:03.960 --> 22:04.759
You're back.

22:08.930 --> 22:09.999
Let me introduce you.

22:10.259 --> 22:12.100
This is my colleague, Yang Si Jia.

22:12.400 --> 22:13.700
This is my friend, Xiao Yi Xiao.

22:13.870 --> 22:14.970
He insisted on taking me home.

22:15.329 --> 22:17.140
Dr. Yang, we've met before.

22:17.299 --> 22:18.269
It's you.

22:19.370 --> 22:20.069
What's the matter?

22:20.140 --> 22:22.140
Are you worried that Xu Qin is with me?

22:22.309 --> 22:23.110
No.

22:23.339 --> 22:24.910
Knowing that she's with you. I rest assured.

22:25.079 --> 22:26.049
Don't worry.

22:26.880 --> 22:28.610
Then you should go home first.

22:28.979 --> 22:30.019
I won't bother you anymore.

22:30.249 --> 22:30.920
I'm tired.

22:31.579 --> 22:32.450
I'll go inside and rest.

22:32.989 --> 22:33.720
Get some good rest.

22:39.390 --> 22:40.390
Is everything okay?

22:40.890 --> 22:41.559
Yes.

22:42.029 --> 22:43.100
She's been staying with you lately.

22:43.630 --> 22:44.600
Sorry to trouble you.

22:45.229 --> 22:46.130
Dr. Yang.

22:46.200 --> 22:47.670
I'll add you on WeChat.

22:48.069 --> 22:49.200
If anything happens to Qin Er,

22:49.269 --> 22:50.370
you can call me anytime.

22:51.269 --> 22:51.970
Okay.

22:52.299 --> 22:53.170
I'll scan your code.

22:57.509 --> 22:58.210
Done.

22:58.509 --> 22:59.380
She's with me.

22:59.509 --> 23:00.350
Don't worry.

23:00.809 --> 23:02.180
- Okay. I'll get going then. - All right.

23:35.009 --> 23:35.809
Song Yan.

23:35.979 --> 23:37.450
Do you want to take a leave to visit Dr. Xu?

23:38.049 --> 23:39.920
Take a leave? It's not that serious.

23:40.650 --> 23:41.549
Is it not serious?

23:43.789 --> 23:44.589
It is serious.

23:45.420 --> 23:47.289
Song Yan, I don't mean to criticize you.

23:47.589 --> 23:48.759
I get that Dr. Xu is angry.

23:48.829 --> 23:50.430
If it were me, I would be angry too.

23:50.499 --> 23:52.130
A girl is injured.

23:52.200 --> 23:53.829
This is the time when she needs care and love.

23:53.900 --> 23:55.829
How can her boyfriend not care about her?

23:56.269 --> 23:57.170
What did you say?

23:57.299 --> 23:58.269
She's injured?

23:59.299 --> 24:00.239
Didn't Dr. Xu tell you?

24:01.239 --> 24:02.509
Xiao Xi called me.

24:02.569 --> 24:03.680
She hurt her wrist.

24:04.079 --> 24:04.880
What happened?

24:05.210 --> 24:07.009
She said someone caused a scene at the emergency room...

24:07.079 --> 24:07.809
this afternoon.

24:07.880 --> 24:09.479
He had a knife and cut her wrist.

24:09.549 --> 24:10.479
She even had surgery.

24:37.479 --> 24:38.680
Send me Xu Xi's number.

24:39.680 --> 24:40.809
Okay. Hold up.

24:50.660 --> 24:51.390
Hello?

24:52.289 --> 24:53.489
My phone is on silent mode.

24:53.660 --> 24:54.660
How's your hand?

24:57.029 --> 24:57.930
It's broken.

25:04.269 --> 25:05.170
It's fine.

25:05.239 --> 25:05.900
That guy didn't hold the knife properly.

25:05.970 --> 25:07.970
It's just a superficial wound. It's not deep.

25:09.170 --> 25:10.509
I'll be fine in a few days.

25:19.180 --> 25:20.049
Xu Qin.

25:23.089 --> 25:23.920
We...

25:28.630 --> 25:30.600
We're just fighting. We didn't break up.

25:34.499 --> 25:35.700
But we didn't fight either.

25:43.279 --> 25:44.079
Yang Chi.

25:44.710 --> 25:45.440
Xu Xi's phone number.

25:45.509 --> 25:46.410
Hurry up.

25:46.549 --> 25:48.110
- You still want it? - Send it to me.

26:13.569 --> 26:14.710
You didn't bring your keys?

26:17.680 --> 26:18.539
How's your hand?

26:19.279 --> 26:20.079
It's fine.

26:20.880 --> 26:22.110
- Let me see. - Don't touch it.

26:24.319 --> 26:25.720
Okay. I won't touch it.

26:28.350 --> 26:29.220
Does it still hurt?

26:31.019 --> 26:32.860
No. Why are you here?

26:36.400 --> 26:37.829
I'm here to see my girlfriend.

26:39.870 --> 26:40.670
Look.

26:41.470 --> 26:42.900
I bought you cake, milk tea,

26:43.239 --> 26:44.100
and fried chicken.

26:45.700 --> 26:47.670
Are you here to deliver food?

26:47.870 --> 26:48.739
I...

26:51.940 --> 26:52.880
Let's go home.

26:53.180 --> 26:54.150
Which home?

26:54.479 --> 26:55.450
Our home.

26:57.749 --> 26:58.779
Our?

26:59.220 --> 27:00.450
Is there still an "our"?

27:13.130 --> 27:14.029
Xu Qin.

27:14.930 --> 27:16.470
I sincerely apologize to you.

27:18.299 --> 27:19.299
Why are you apologizing?

27:20.370 --> 27:21.370
Like you said,

27:22.210 --> 27:23.610
I was too full of myself.

27:24.309 --> 27:25.710
I made a lot of decisions...

27:26.350 --> 27:27.979
without discussing it with you.

27:30.019 --> 27:31.120
To put it nicely,

27:31.220 --> 27:32.180
I didn't want you to worry...

27:32.579 --> 27:33.549
or pressure you.

27:35.690 --> 27:36.620
But frankly,

27:38.360 --> 27:39.390
I'm just running away.

27:40.059 --> 27:41.229
When I don't want to face you,

27:42.660 --> 27:43.630
I'm in a dilemma.

27:45.930 --> 27:46.799
Go on.

27:49.499 --> 27:50.839
I had been single for so many years.

27:51.440 --> 27:52.839
I was used to it.

27:53.870 --> 27:54.940
There are many bad habits...

27:55.339 --> 27:56.380
that I don't realize.

27:57.079 --> 27:58.339
But when I am with you,

27:58.880 --> 27:59.910
I can't be like this.

28:02.650 --> 28:03.479
I'll change.

28:04.620 --> 28:05.620
I'll definitely change.

28:06.549 --> 28:07.819
If there's anything in the future,

28:08.150 --> 28:09.759
I'll discuss it with you.

28:10.390 --> 28:11.160
Okay?

28:13.759 --> 28:14.559
I promise.

28:18.499 --> 28:19.229
That's it?

28:25.370 --> 28:26.269
What about this?

28:34.410 --> 28:36.350
Let's not dwell on this, okay?

28:37.019 --> 28:39.049
It's not that I want to dwell on it.

28:40.350 --> 28:41.150
I just don't think...

28:41.220 --> 28:43.160
you trust me as much as I trust you.

28:43.759 --> 28:44.960
I don't hide anything from you.

28:45.019 --> 28:46.019
But what about you?

28:46.430 --> 28:48.660
To come this far for us and our future,

28:48.729 --> 28:50.299
I had to leave everything behind.

28:50.600 --> 28:52.329
You're making me...

28:53.470 --> 28:54.200
Xu Qin.

28:56.370 --> 28:57.670
Let's give it some more time.

29:00.569 --> 29:02.210
Even if you're angry, you have to eat.

29:02.569 --> 29:03.610
Call me if you need anything.

29:17.089 --> 29:18.420
We haven't broken up, right?

29:19.759 --> 29:20.489
Get lost.

29:20.930 --> 29:21.789
All right.

29:34.309 --> 29:36.309
Have you forgotten what happened in the past?

29:36.809 --> 29:38.339
It took you so much...

29:38.410 --> 29:39.279
to become an outstanding soldier...

29:39.339 --> 29:40.579
and get a guaranteed place in the military academy.

29:40.809 --> 29:42.509
But right before the evaluation,

29:42.579 --> 29:43.519
something happened.

29:44.120 --> 29:45.819
You didn't do well in the exam. What happened?

29:46.019 --> 29:47.450
Why did you join the army?

29:47.519 --> 29:49.450
Why did you become a firefighter?

29:50.989 --> 29:52.160
What about this?

30:03.269 --> 30:04.670
Since you chose to repeat your studies,

30:05.239 --> 30:06.440
you should work hard.

30:07.309 --> 30:09.110
I can't get into your university even if I work hard.

30:09.370 --> 30:10.880
You can apply to another school.

30:11.079 --> 30:12.279
Which one do you want to go to?

30:13.150 --> 30:14.110
It's a secret.

30:14.710 --> 30:16.049
There are secrets between us?

30:24.559 --> 30:26.420
I'll have to trouble you with this.

30:28.289 --> 30:29.029
It's nothing.

30:29.089 --> 30:30.160
I'm begging you.

30:30.229 --> 30:31.229
Let my child go!

30:31.299 --> 30:33.430
- You can't ruin his future! - Get him out of here.

30:33.630 --> 30:34.400
I'm begging you!

30:34.470 --> 30:35.630
- Security. - I'm begging you.

30:35.700 --> 30:36.700
Let my son go!

30:36.769 --> 30:38.900
You can't ruin his future like this!

30:39.039 --> 30:40.370
I'm begging you!

30:46.880 --> 30:48.350
You did well this time.

30:48.610 --> 30:50.019
You've been awarded a second-class merit.

30:51.249 --> 30:52.519
When you recover,

30:53.049 --> 30:54.319
I'll give you a promotion.

30:54.789 --> 30:56.890
You can marry her proudly then.

30:59.690 --> 31:02.989
(Grave of Song Zhi Yong)

31:08.229 --> 31:09.130
Dad.

31:10.039 --> 31:11.470
I haven't visited you in a long time.

31:12.299 --> 31:13.370
It's not that I don't miss you.

31:14.069 --> 31:15.309
It's just that some time ago,

31:15.640 --> 31:16.779
I was on a mission.

31:17.710 --> 31:18.410
That place...

31:19.279 --> 31:20.509
is far from our house.

31:21.350 --> 31:22.410
It's humid and hot.

31:23.420 --> 31:24.620
Did I get a tan?

31:27.549 --> 31:28.220
Right.

31:28.620 --> 31:29.789
I have good news for you.

31:30.660 --> 31:31.660
For this mission,

31:32.259 --> 31:33.259
I got second-class merit.

31:34.059 --> 31:35.559
I'll get a promotion soon.

31:36.529 --> 31:37.400
From now on,

31:38.100 --> 31:39.630
you don't have to worry anymore.

31:39.930 --> 31:40.729
Your son...

31:41.670 --> 31:42.729
will be successful.

31:49.539 --> 31:51.180
Xiao Yan, you're here too.

31:52.710 --> 31:53.610
What are you doing here?

31:54.279 --> 31:55.110
It's Yong's memorial day.

31:55.180 --> 31:56.720
As his buddy, I have to be here.

31:57.249 --> 31:58.720
What kind of buddy are you?

31:59.180 --> 32:00.350
He stood up for you,

32:00.450 --> 32:01.620
but you bit him in the back.

32:02.350 --> 32:03.089
Xiao Yan.

32:03.150 --> 32:04.160
That was a long time ago.

32:04.220 --> 32:06.220
What? Are you still holding a grudge against me?

32:06.759 --> 32:07.559
Here.

32:08.390 --> 32:09.229
Yong.

32:09.360 --> 32:10.660
I know you like this.

32:10.729 --> 32:11.860
I brought it especially for you.

32:12.860 --> 32:14.200
How could you let your dad drink such bad wine?

32:14.900 --> 32:15.870
This is good wine.

32:15.930 --> 32:16.970
You haven't you tried it before.

32:17.640 --> 32:18.440
What are you doing?

32:18.499 --> 32:19.640
You don't deserve to serve him wine.

32:20.910 --> 32:21.569
Xiao Yan.

32:22.739 --> 32:24.110
What happened to your dad back then...

32:24.180 --> 32:25.180
was not my fault.

32:25.779 --> 32:26.440
If it weren't for him,

32:26.509 --> 32:28.650
everyone would have gotten more.

32:28.880 --> 32:30.079
He wasn't capable,

32:30.150 --> 32:31.749
but he still stood up for others.

32:31.819 --> 32:32.920
If he was capable,

32:32.979 --> 32:34.390
would your mom have run away?

32:35.989 --> 32:36.890
That's right.

32:37.620 --> 32:39.589
Your dad must have died because of your mom.

32:39.660 --> 32:40.789
Which man can accept it...

32:40.989 --> 32:43.600
after getting cheated on by his wife?

32:45.299 --> 32:46.829
So if you want to hate someone, it shouldn't be me.

32:46.900 --> 32:48.470
You should hate that promiscuous woman...

32:48.529 --> 32:49.930
- who despises the poor. - Mom!

32:50.900 --> 32:51.670
Mom!

32:52.970 --> 32:54.110
She infuriated your dad to death.

32:54.170 --> 32:55.339
What does it have to do with me?

33:01.680 --> 33:02.579
Mr. Wu.

33:02.850 --> 33:05.249
Look, in order to have evidence that he hit someone,

33:05.850 --> 33:07.650
my face is full of bruises.

33:08.220 --> 33:09.319
Even my arm is broken.

33:09.589 --> 33:11.019
This is the real deal.

33:11.089 --> 33:12.190
I hired someone to hit me.

33:12.259 --> 33:13.120
With my broken arm,

33:13.190 --> 33:14.489
I won't be able to do anything for six months.

33:14.559 --> 33:16.229
How will my family make a living?

33:18.430 --> 33:20.200
Has Song Yan's uncle come to see you recently?

33:20.829 --> 33:21.999
Don't worry.

33:22.069 --> 33:24.339
Even if it's his uncle or someone from the army,

33:24.539 --> 33:25.839
I won't accept mediation.

33:26.100 --> 33:27.640
I'll make sure he's kicked out of the army.

34:02.839 --> 34:04.079
Song Yan.

34:12.380 --> 34:14.150
Why do you want to become a firefighter?

34:14.450 --> 34:15.249
Sir.

34:15.720 --> 34:16.759
Be it the special forces...

34:16.819 --> 34:17.759
or a firefighter,

34:18.259 --> 34:19.759
there is a mission and responsibility.

34:20.259 --> 34:21.589
They're both noble professions.

34:22.459 --> 34:23.830
I want my life to be worthwhile.

34:24.399 --> 34:25.529
I want to live as a human being.

34:25.799 --> 34:27.270
On behalf of Shilitai Fire Station,

34:27.330 --> 34:28.529
I welcome you.

34:35.169 --> 34:35.870
Xu Qin.

34:36.980 --> 34:37.739
Wait for me.

34:38.810 --> 34:40.910
I'll stand proudly in front of you.

34:42.549 --> 34:43.350
Wait for me.

35:10.339 --> 35:11.310
Why hasn't Qin Qin been home...

35:11.379 --> 35:12.839
for the past few days?

35:12.910 --> 35:14.080
She wasn't here two days ago.

35:14.149 --> 35:16.149
Why isn't she back when you're back?

35:16.379 --> 35:17.220
She's busy lately.

35:18.520 --> 35:20.649
She's so busy at the hospital that she can't even come home?

35:20.720 --> 35:21.390
How about this?

35:21.450 --> 35:22.350
I'll make some soup later.

35:22.419 --> 35:23.489
Take it to her.

35:23.989 --> 35:24.759
Song Yan.

35:24.819 --> 35:27.060
Did you make my sister-in-law angry?

35:27.560 --> 35:28.459
Don't talk nonsense.

35:29.689 --> 35:31.230
I'm sure he did. Tell us.

35:31.330 --> 35:32.230
What did you do?

35:32.430 --> 35:33.359
Listen up.

35:33.430 --> 35:35.270
If you make her angry and she runs away,

35:35.330 --> 35:36.500
you'll regret it.

35:42.739 --> 35:43.540
I'm done eating.

35:43.609 --> 35:44.480
Take your time.

35:51.720 --> 35:53.250
Did they really have a fight?

35:53.319 --> 35:55.149
It's normal for young couples to fight.

35:55.220 --> 35:56.419
Let them resolve it themselves.

35:56.489 --> 35:57.459
We should stay out of it.

35:58.689 --> 35:59.620
It's weird.

36:00.160 --> 36:02.160
He usually treats Xu Qin...

36:02.230 --> 36:03.500
like a treasure.

36:03.600 --> 36:05.430
The desire to survive must be quite strong.

36:07.730 --> 36:08.930
Eat up.

36:17.009 --> 36:18.109
Are you not feeling well?

36:19.680 --> 36:20.750
Why are you here?

36:21.149 --> 36:22.779
Shouldn't your injury have healed long ago?

36:23.410 --> 36:25.680
It wasn't easy for me to get to see you.

36:25.750 --> 36:27.120
You didn't answer my calls.

36:27.220 --> 36:28.750
I saw you were on duty today,

36:28.819 --> 36:29.950
so I made an appointment.

36:32.759 --> 36:34.489
You're wasting medical resources.

36:34.890 --> 36:36.390
I know I was wrong.

36:36.459 --> 36:37.600
But let me say a few words.

36:37.660 --> 36:38.629
Just a few.

36:39.299 --> 36:40.399
Did your brother send you?

36:40.830 --> 36:43.100
No, I came on my own.

36:43.669 --> 36:46.239
Did you have a fight?

36:47.140 --> 36:48.739
I'm working right now.

36:49.870 --> 36:51.480
Well, since I'm already here,

36:51.580 --> 36:52.739
give me a checkup.

36:53.080 --> 36:53.879
What's wrong?

36:54.080 --> 36:56.810
Can't sleep. Lovesick.

36:57.250 --> 36:58.720
My brother hasn't slept for the past few days.

36:58.779 --> 37:00.450
His eye bags are like a panda's.

37:00.520 --> 37:02.049
If he really did something wrong,

37:02.120 --> 37:03.290
please be generous...

37:03.350 --> 37:04.259
and forgive him, all right?

37:06.660 --> 37:07.660
Next patient.

37:08.589 --> 37:10.660
Xu Qin, don't.

37:13.629 --> 37:14.799
I'll wait for you in the garden.

37:14.870 --> 37:15.830
You have to come.

37:16.129 --> 37:17.140
You must!

37:29.410 --> 37:30.720
Xu Qin, over here.

37:33.350 --> 37:34.120
Zhai Miao.

37:34.720 --> 37:35.689
Xu Qin.

37:36.049 --> 37:37.020
Here, have a seat.

37:42.290 --> 37:43.129
Xu Qin.

37:43.259 --> 37:44.529
I heard from my parents...

37:44.629 --> 37:46.100
that you haven't been home for a long time.

37:47.529 --> 37:49.830
Did my brother make you angry?

37:50.169 --> 37:51.040
Why didn't you tell me?

37:51.100 --> 37:52.270
I'll teach him a lesson for you.

37:53.669 --> 37:54.970
It's not that I don't want to talk to him...

37:55.040 --> 37:56.009
and must fight with him.

37:56.939 --> 37:57.910
I just feel like...

37:58.609 --> 38:00.109
he's keeping a lot of things from me...

38:00.580 --> 38:02.209
and shoulders all the burden alone.

38:02.910 --> 38:03.750
For example,

38:03.980 --> 38:05.620
the gunshot wound on his body.

38:06.350 --> 38:07.589
Your whole family knows about it,

38:07.819 --> 38:08.649
yet you kept it from me.

38:11.390 --> 38:12.689
My brother must have his reasons...

38:13.459 --> 38:14.890
for not telling you.

38:15.230 --> 38:16.390
He's doing it for your own good.

38:16.790 --> 38:18.060
Zhai Miao.

38:18.200 --> 38:20.730
If it were you, would you accept this explanation?

38:23.569 --> 38:25.140
It's nothing, really.

38:25.540 --> 38:27.669
It's just that my brother was in the special forces...

38:28.169 --> 38:29.310
and made some contributions.

38:30.480 --> 38:31.310
Then why...

38:31.480 --> 38:32.779
did he become a firefighter?

38:36.149 --> 38:37.220
Xu Qin.

38:37.279 --> 38:39.419
Is this why you had a fight with my brother?

38:46.390 --> 38:47.189
Forget it.

38:48.989 --> 38:49.930
Anyway,

38:50.230 --> 38:51.600
I'm a bit tired.

38:52.660 --> 38:53.459
So tired...

38:54.930 --> 38:56.500
that I don't want to be with him anymore.

38:57.839 --> 39:00.339
Xu Qin, is it that serious?

39:01.669 --> 39:03.810
My brother really didn't...

39:06.540 --> 39:07.379
You know what?

39:07.680 --> 39:08.879
I think your brother is unreliable.

39:08.950 --> 39:11.149
How could my brother be unreliable?

39:11.350 --> 39:12.149
My brother...

39:12.950 --> 39:15.049
He did a lot of things for you.

39:15.120 --> 39:16.689
He just doesn't tell you about it.

39:16.950 --> 39:19.790
He loves you with his entire being, Xu Qin.

39:19.859 --> 39:21.459
You're his sister, of course you'd say that.

39:21.660 --> 39:23.830
But from what I saw, after he got me as his girlfriend,

39:23.899 --> 39:24.799
he didn't cherish me anymore.

39:25.459 --> 39:26.330
Because of him,

39:26.500 --> 39:28.069
I almost severed my ties with my family.

39:28.600 --> 39:29.700
But what did he do?

39:31.669 --> 39:32.470
Forget it.

39:32.669 --> 39:33.739
You don't have to say anything.

39:34.040 --> 39:35.109
I'll get going.

39:37.279 --> 39:38.080
Xu Qin!

39:38.910 --> 39:39.580
Xu Qin.

39:40.180 --> 39:40.910
I'll tell you.

39:41.149 --> 39:42.149
I'll tell you.

39:42.580 --> 39:44.250
I'll tell you.

39:47.649 --> 39:49.049
When my brother repeated his studies,

39:49.419 --> 39:50.819
didn't you two break up?

39:51.419 --> 39:52.989
He studied very hard...

39:53.060 --> 39:53.890
and worked out...

39:53.959 --> 39:55.830
in hopes of getting into the military academy.

39:56.259 --> 39:57.959
He thought if he became an officer in the army,

39:58.029 --> 39:59.299
he would be successful...

39:59.399 --> 40:00.700
and worthy enough for you.

40:00.830 --> 40:02.230
But I don't know why.

40:02.629 --> 40:04.439
During the medical examination, he didn't pass.

40:05.339 --> 40:06.700
That's why he failed.

40:06.970 --> 40:08.839
My dad suspected a problem with the medical report,

40:09.009 --> 40:11.279
so he took him to the hospital for a re-examination.

40:11.540 --> 40:13.540
He found that his data were all qualified.

40:13.779 --> 40:15.279
My dad went around complaining.

40:15.350 --> 40:17.049
He wanted to fight for a chance for my brother.

40:18.149 --> 40:18.980
Then...

40:19.620 --> 40:20.950
he begged your mom.

40:22.649 --> 40:23.589
What did you say?

40:23.859 --> 40:24.819
My dad said...

40:25.390 --> 40:27.020
that it was your mom...

40:27.089 --> 40:28.089
who bribed the doctor.

40:28.660 --> 40:30.330
Until the end of the military academy admissions,

40:30.459 --> 40:32.430
my brother didn't get the chance for a re-examination.

40:39.839 --> 40:42.140
Xu Qin, are you all right?

40:43.810 --> 40:45.580
My brother didn't want me to tell you...

40:46.339 --> 40:48.080
because he didn't want you to feel bad.

40:51.379 --> 40:52.319
And then?

40:52.750 --> 40:54.220
How did he get shot?

40:55.549 --> 40:56.549
He wanted to be a soldier.

40:56.989 --> 40:59.259
Because he was strong and hardworking,

40:59.589 --> 41:01.160
he was recruited...

41:01.230 --> 41:02.060
by the border force.

41:03.189 --> 41:04.129
He got hurt...

41:04.730 --> 41:06.730
while he was on a mission.

41:10.299 --> 41:11.339
He risked his life...

41:12.239 --> 41:13.939
to get a chance for a promotion.

41:14.439 --> 41:16.140
But because of a tip-off call,

41:16.739 --> 41:18.109
everything was ruined.

41:19.080 --> 41:21.279
After that, he left the army...

41:21.379 --> 41:22.350
and went to the fire station.

41:22.950 --> 41:24.149
You know what happened...

41:24.720 --> 41:25.919
after that.

41:26.580 --> 41:28.720
As for the person who made the tip-off call,

41:29.319 --> 41:30.390
I'm sure you know who made it...

41:31.390 --> 41:32.589
even if I don't tell you.

41:40.430 --> 41:41.270
Xu Qin.

41:41.899 --> 41:43.600
Do you now know why my brother...

41:43.669 --> 41:44.700
didn't want to tell you?

41:47.239 --> 41:48.970
When he was going through a hard time,

41:49.709 --> 41:50.980
when he was in despair,

41:52.379 --> 41:54.180
the thing that kept him going...

41:54.779 --> 41:55.609
was you.

42:26.939 --> 42:28.279
Dr. Xu, you're going home?
